      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Breaux_Bridge%2C_Louisiana"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The town grew around a footbridge built by Firmin Breaux in 1799 across Bayou Têche, later replaced by a vehicular bridge in 1817.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        21,
        29
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Breaux_Bridge%2C_Louisiana"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Breaux Bridge earned the nickname “Crawfish Capital of the World” officially designated by Speaker Bob Angelle.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        5
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
