      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Breaux_Bridge%2C_Louisiana"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Acadian exile heritage blends French, Spanish, African, Native American, and Caribbean influences into Cajun culture celebrated in gumbo and Zydeco.",
